    "message": "Add independent native PNR and direct-click sampling routes\n\nImplement safeguarded Newton flow and deterministic CPU trajectory workers for PNR, plus a direct binary-click Gaussian moment-closure core. Retain generic-CPU same-input Frugal comparisons and all numerical failures.\n\nAdd a binary128 small-system PNR oracle and full-count 20M/80M quality experiments without truncating rare tails. Public interfaces replay 800576 records. Full suite: 828 run, 799 passed, no failures/errors; historical skips retained. No universal or equal-quality quantum-advantage claim.",
